   "時獄の果てに: 'At the End of the Time Prison' (時獄 = Time Prison, as in the glossary's 時獄戦役 = Time Prison War).",
   "Names in titles written as plain English matching the glossary (Zeon, Otis, Itsukushima, Wrath Babylon, Namsac, Straus, Riddhe, Haman), like the existing stage-title rows (新地球皇国 = New Earth Empire), not as $$tokens$$.",
   "毒針: 'The Poison Needle', picked to echo Barbiel the Needle (the Blue Earth stage involving Barbiel); not verified against the stage file.",
   "再会の火の星: 火の星 read as Mars ('the Red Planet'); 2040's cast (Banjou, Rand, Setsuko, Crowe) and the parallel MQ stage 'Mars Encounter' support it.",
   "果てなき破壊の化身: story English uses 'incarnation(s) of endless destruction'; shortened to 'Endless Destruction Incarnate' to fit the card.",
   "帰ることなき故郷: from Umemoto's line on Gabar ('a homeland I can never return to') -> 'The Homeland of No Return'.",
   "闇の兄、光の弟: Marg (elder, darkness) / Takeru (younger, light); 'Dark Brother, Light Brother' drops elder/younger.",
   "北米戦線、波高し: idiom (rough seas = tension) -> 'Stormy North American Front'.",
   "宇宙の神: matches the story's 'the god of space' (dlg_2069)."
